==English==
{{was wotd|2008|March|28}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|caterwrawen}}, from {{m|enm|cater||cat}} + {{m|enm|wrawen}}, {{m|enm|wrawlen||cry like a cat}}, equivalent to {{compound|en|cat|waul}}. Compare {{cog|nds|katerwaulen|t=to cry like a cat}} and {{cog|dum|cater|t=tomcat}} ({{cog|nl|kater}}).

